flowchart TD
    U[Upload file] --> V{Validate format}
    V -- invalid --> U
    V -- valid --> R[Render preview]
    V -. original .-> S[(Asset store)]
    R -. preview .-> S
    R --> C{Automatic checks}
    C -- "fail, retry max 3" --> R
    C -- pass --> H[Human review]
    H -- changes requested --> U
    H -- approve --> P[Publish]
    P -. release entry .-> A[(Audit log)]
    P --> L([Live on site])
